msgid "How to upgrade to Qubes 4.3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_3.rst:5
#: 2214c686fc0e44b8a606d2fa4a14a93f
msgid ""
"This page explains how to **upgrade from Qubes 4.2 to Qubes 4.3**. There are "
"two ways to upgrade:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_3.rst:7
#: bea2561164c34b33948ec99ea4e9a856
msgid "a clean installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_3.rst:8
#: 35cff32829b14be0900cb2e1ef3f2ee7
msgid "or an in-place upgrade."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_3.rst:10
#: b4ae066b02fa42cdb78c06393bd423d8
msgid ""
"In general, **a clean installation is simpler and less error-prone**, but an "
"in-place upgrade allows you to preserve your customizations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_3.rst:12
#: 176c66adc5d44b5e990147c2b14e80ce
msgid ""
"It is not possible to upgrade directly from releases earlier than 4.2. If "
"you’re still on an earlier release, please either perform a :ref:`clean "
"installation of 4.3 <clean-installation-4.3>` or :doc:`upgrade to 4.2 </user/"
"downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_2>` first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_3.rst:15
#: a52e2b9e14714adc9b241672ccaf15c2
msgid "First step: do a backup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_3.rst:17
#: aea11ff728974bb7a037c12a8c13cc76
msgid ""
"Before attempting either an in-place upgrade or a clean installation, we "
"**strongly recommend** that you first :doc:`back up your system </user/how-"
"to-guides/how-to-back-up-restore-and-migrate>` so that you don’t lose any "
"data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/upgrade/4_3.rst:19
#: 29f1e60c7fbb491cb776a29e0b9e0268
msgid ""
"You can optionally :ref:`run the updater <user/how-to-guides/how-to-"
"update:Installing updates>` to ensure all of your qubes are in their latest "
"version, **before doing the backup**."
msgstr ""

